  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Art for Development, Promoting Freedom of Expression Through Culture &amp; A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to realization of human rights through enabling young people and artists in selected provinces of mozambique to carry out income generating activities in the areas of arts and culture. The initiative entails generating income, through diversified technical and life skills, training and education of young artists, responsible use of freedom of expression, and increased dissemination of artistic activities, production and cultural heritage</narrative>
  </description>
